{"reviewId": "9910002_86DLlYHrC", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "不能把作者说的放到现在去对比发现不一致而认为说错了。这恰恰是长周期和短周期的区别所在：当前的痛苦期其实是短周期，而不得不承认的是，10年左右之后很多行业确实在长周期上大幅提升工资，当时的环境是不提工资就跳槽，这也就是作者提到的两个趋势：劳动力想分得更多蛋糕，不涨钱我就跳槽；而公司追求效率，宁愿花大价钱去挖人。这种趋势持续很久，甚至现在阶段性的有一些回光返照的时候也是如此。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "劳动力会要求议价权力，以期重分蛋糕，资方会重视提高效率，以期做大蛋糕，于是问题逐步泛政治化——这就是我们前面描述的社会景象。", "range": "24859-24921", "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "9910002_86DLlYHrC", "userVid": 9910002, "topics": [], "createTime": 1770109125, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 9910002, "name": "梧杨", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0027-VqQIAjS0P6hXYWEB_AjyEb7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "梧杨", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 10, "likes": [{"userVid": 432314804, "name": "🍰 July.L.🌸", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKYeJE9DcjluxdkFicEu78T6QQqDkiboY4Awkg575s3zt909VVChm733fUfKLpMDiaB7HOic9UyOwTSP4LfJEtTfL8qPvC5KZlKXJq3NuLAKrP45g/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "普通人的工资其实没有多大的变化，", "reviewId": "9910002_86DLlYHrC", "commentId": "9910002_86DLlYHrC_c912099471_88S4q